---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于">
  <article class="about-page">
    <h1>关于这个网站</h1>
    
    <section>
      <h2>初衷</h2>
      <p>
        喜欢樊振东的人大多是慕强而来，但我想记录的重点不是樊振东的<strong>战绩</strong>，
        而是更耀眼的<strong>意志、人品、纯真、良善、机智、幽默</strong>，以及他<strong>在喧嚣中的清醒与坚守</strong>、<strong>直面荆棘时的捍卫与孤勇</strong>。
      </p>
      <p>
        这个网站就像一本需要集思广益、不断完善的杂志。
        这种主观记录本身不像已成定论的过往成绩一样毋庸置疑，只能用个人心中的尺子衡量。
      </p>
      <p>
        我的原则是<strong>尽可能尊重事实、不违反公序良俗，一切为了宣扬樊振东精神，希望他能成为更多人的偶像</strong>。
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>内容来源</h2>
      <p>
        这一年多，互联网冲浪刷了几百小时关于樊振东的短视频和微博、公众号等内容，
        此番无非是将脑海中的内容整理分类记录在案。素材收集于互联网各处，如有侵权或事实有纰漏之处，可联系删改。
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>参与贡献</h2>
      <p>
        这是一个开放的项目，欢迎所有樊振东的球迷参与贡献内容。
        如果你有好的素材、故事、链接，欢迎投稿:<a href="mailto:kkjusdoit@gmail.com">kkjusdoit@gmail.com</a>。
      </p>
    </section>

      <section>
      <h2>勘误说明</h2>
      <p>
        限于个人能力，加之参考资料庞杂，整理过程中虽已尽力考证，但也难免出现理解偏差或表述不当。如有纰漏，欢迎批评指正，我会第一时间进行勘误。
      </p>
    </section>



    <section>
      <h2>免责声明</h2>
      <p>
        本网站纯属个人为爱发电，如因主观内容引发不必要的争议，与樊振东本人及团队无关。
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>相关链接</h2>
      <ul class="related-links">
        <li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/YpElhONaPWjn1nIx9uMULg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">樊振东的互联网档案馆｜fzd-fans.com网站建成纪实</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>📋 更新日志</h2>
      <p>
        查看网站的更新历史和后续计划：<a href="/changelog">更新日志&共创致谢 →</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="slogan">
      <!-- 乒乓球动画 -->
      <div class="ping-pong-balls">
        <span class="ball ball-1">🏓</span>
        <span class="ball ball-2">🏓</span>
        <span class="ball ball-3">🏓</span>
      </div>
      
      <!-- 奥运五环 SVG - 使用mask实现交织 -->
      <svg class="olympic-rings" viewBox="0 0 504 228" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <defs>
          <!-- 蓝环遮罩 - 遮住黄环穿过的部分 -->
          <mask id="mask-yellow">
            <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="white"/>
            <circle cx="100" cy="88" r="77" fill="black"/>
          </mask>
          <!-- 黑环遮罩 - 遮住绿环穿过的部分 -->
          <mask id="mask-green">
            <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="white"/>
            <circle cx="252" cy="88" r="77" fill="black"/>
          </mask>
        </defs>
        
        <!-- 上排三环 (蓝、黑、红) -->
        <circle cx="100" cy="88" r="72" fill="none" stroke="#0085c7" stroke-width="10"/>
        <circle cx="252" cy="88" r="72" fill="none" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="10"/>
        <circle cx="404" cy="88" r="72" fill="none" stroke="#df0024" stroke-width="10"/>
        
        <!-- 下排两环 (黄、绿) - 完整圆环 -->
        <circle cx="176" cy="140" r="72" fill="none" stroke="#f4c300" stroke-width="10"/>
        <circle cx="328" cy="140" r="72" fill="none" stroke="#009f3d" stroke-width="10"/>
        
        <!-- 交织部分：上排环覆盖下排环的右下角 -->
        <!-- 蓝环覆盖黄环 -->
        <path d="M 100 88 m 0 -72 a 72 72 0 0 1 62 36 a 72 72 0 0 1 10 36 a 72 72 0 0 1 -10 36" fill="none" stroke="#0085c7" stroke-width="10"/>
        <!-- 黑环覆盖黄环和绿环 -->
        <path d="M 252 88 m 0 -72 a 72 72 0 0 1 62 36 a 72 72 0 0 1 10 36 a 72 72 0 0 1 -10 36" fill="none" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="10"/>
        <path d="M 252 88 m 0 -72 a 72 72 0 0 0 -62 36 a 72 72 0 0 0 -10 36 a 72 72 0 0 0 10 36" fill="none" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="10"/>
        <!-- 红环覆盖绿环 -->
        <path d="M 404 88 m 0 -72 a 72 72 0 0 0 -62 36 a 72 72 0 0 0 -10 36 a 72 72 0 0 0 10 36" fill="none" stroke="#df0024" stroke-width="10"/>
      </svg>
      
      <!-- 金牌装饰 -->
      <div class="medal-container">
        <span class="medal">🥇</span>
      </div>
      
      <blockquote>
        <span class="slogan-text">樊振东 闪耀洛杉矶</span>
        <span class="year">2028</span>
      </blockquote>
      
      <!-- 星星装饰 -->
      <div class="stars">
        <span class="star">✨</span>
        <span class="star">⭐</span>
        <span class="star">✨</span>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 0;
  }
  h1 { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  section { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  h2 { 
    color: #1e88e5; 
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }
  p { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  
  .related-links {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }
  
  .related-links li {
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }
  
  .related-links li::before {
    content: '🔗';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
  }
  
  .related-links a {
    color: #1e88e5;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  
  .related-links a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  
  /* 炫酷 Slogan 样式 */
  .slogan {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 50%, #0f3460 100%);
    border-radius: 20px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }
  
  .slogan::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background: 
      radial-gradient(circle at 20% 80%, rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  
  /* 乒乓球动画 */
  .ping-pong-balls {
    position: absolute;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  
  .ball {
    position: absolute;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    animation: bounce 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  
  .ball-1 { top: 10%; left: 10%; animation-delay: 0s; }
  .ball-2 { top: 20%; right: 15%; animation-delay: 1s; }
  .ball-3 { bottom: 15%; left: 20%; animation-delay: 2s; }
  
  @keyframes bounce {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-15px) rotate(180deg); }
  }
  
  /* 奥运五环 SVG */
  .olympic-rings {
    width: 180px;
    height: 80px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    animation: ringsPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  
  @keyframes ringsPulse {
    0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.9; }
    50% { transform: scale(1.05); opacity: 1; }
  }
  
  /* 金牌 */
  .medal-container {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  
  .medal {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    display: inline-block;
    animation: medalShine 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.6));
  }
  
  @keyframes medalShine {
    0%, 100% { 
      transform: scale(1) rotateY(0deg); 
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.6));
    }
    50% { 
      transform: scale(1.1) rotateY(15deg); 
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 30px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.9));
    }
  }
  
  /* Slogan 文字 */
  blockquote {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-style: normal;
    margin: 0;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  
  .slogan-text {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffd700, #ffec8b, #ffd700);
    background-size: 200% auto;
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    animation: shimmer 3s linear infinite;
    display: block;
    text-shadow: none;
  }
  
  @keyframes shimmer {
    0% { background-position: -200% center; }
    100% { background-position: 200% center; }
  }
  
  .year {
    display: block;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: #1e88e5;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.5);
    animation: yearGlow 2s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }
  
  @keyframes yearGlow {
    0% { text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.5); }
    100% { text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.8), 0 0 40px rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.4); }
  }
  
  /* 星星装饰 */
  .stars {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  
  .star {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin: 0 0.5rem;
    animation: twinkle 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  
  .star:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0s; }
  .star:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.5s; }
  .star:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 1s; }
  
  @keyframes twinkle {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 0.5; transform: scale(1); }
    50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.3); }
  }
</style>
